- [ ] **Check Shared Package**: Review `packages/shared/src/types/`, `packages/shared/src/utils/`, and `packages/shared/src/config/` for existing resources
- [ ] Read and understand the full plan context
- [ ] Identify which step(s) to execute
- [ ] Verify prerequisites are met
- [ ] Read target file(s) to understand current state
- [ ] **Verify Shared Resources**: Check if types/utilities from `@shared` should be used instead of creating new ones
- [ ] Implement changes as specified
- [ ] **Use Shared Imports**: Import from `@shared` package where applicable
- [ ] Check for linting/compilation errors
- [ ] Verify implementation matches step description
- [ ] **Update Documentation**: Check if implementation requires updates to `documentation/` files and update accordingly:
  - [ ] `documentation/architecture.md` (if architecture/structure changed)
  - [ ] `documentation/api.md` (if APIs changed)
